<p>Sometimes, being a master tinker requires taking risks; yours are more calculated than others.</p><p>Gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 6, 8, 10</acronym> cunning, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 12, 16, 21, 25</acronym> physical save, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">13%, 25%, 33%, 39%, 44%</acronym> resistance to self-inflicted damage, and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 12%, 17%, 21%, 25%</acronym> chance to avoid being critically hit.</p>